00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:43.520
The Muslims were terribly intelligent. What they did is, for instance, the Greek philosophy that was expelled by the Christians, because the Christian church didn't want any philosophy. They were afraid that the people would ask, how come that two and one, which are three, are equal to one? Because they believe that the three are one, and one and three, and all this nonsense. So they expelled all this kind of philosophy.

