Outside Babylonia, there were no centers of Jewish studies. The Talmud is one of the most incomprehensible books ever written. You cannot just open the Talmud and read the Talmud like if you open, say, Aristotle or Plato and read it. It's impossible. And there were no commentaries at the time.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:14.520
A miracle happens, and we don't know exactly how. In Egypt, develops a young man by the name of Sadia el-Fayoumi. Sadia means his name. El-Fayoumi is because he was born in Fayoum.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:42.520
